                      <TextRun>
                        <Value>="(2)  That any payrolls otherwise under this contract required to be submitted for the above period are correct and complete, that wage rates for laborers or mechanics contained therein are not less than the applicable wage rates contained in any wage determination incorporated into the contract; that the classifications set forth therein for each laborer or mechanic conform with the work he performed. "</Value>
